# Pins

Dependencies float: manifests carry the tool's default specifier
(`uv add` → `>=`{% if with_rust %}, `cargo add` → caret{% endif %}), the committed lockfiles record the resolved versions, and
`just upgrade` moves them to the latest at an agent's discretion. This page lists only the deliberate exceptions — an
exact version, cap, git rev or hold-back — each with the reason specific to that dependency and
when to revisit it. Add, change or remove a row with the `pin-check` skill. A dependency with
no row here is whatever the lockfile holds.

## Toolchains

