{%- if with_rust %}

A caret requirement (what `cargo add` writes) needs nothing here. An exact `=x.y.z` or a git
`rev` needs a row in this table; `just deps` checks that it has one. Declare crate families
that must resolve to one version in `[workspace.metadata.pins] families` in `Cargo.toml`.
{%- endif %}
{%- if with_docs_site %}

Documentation binaries are listed in [site.toml](site.toml). A tool listed there without a
version means the latest; a version given there is a pin and needs a row here. Change them with
focused `just docs-test` and `just docs-check`.
{%- endif %}
